  "claim_boundary": "This twelve-record water panel is a hard minimum chemistry-coverage and historical-regression gate for Route-2 V0. It contains the exact original ten-record FreeSolv set where the retired GTO/QEq/GBn2 screen reached 7.041442082076966 kcal/mol on ethyl acetate, and adds acetamide plus acetic acid so that ten actual, distinct source-labelled functional groups are mandatory. Methane and benzene are retained as nonfunctional polarizability/cavity controls and are explicitly excluded from the ten-functional-group count. No candidate prediction is stored here. Passing this panel alone does not establish variational correctness, force/PES validity, multi-solvent coverage, or blind generalization.",
